It is night now.
I am in my home.
I stand near the window.
The window is open.
Now, it is not raining.
I look outside.
Below, the street is wet.
In the morning, there was harsh sun.
Now, it is not hot.
The air is fresh and cool.
The weather is very beautiful.
A BEST bus goes on the street.
The bus's light falls on the wet street.
I remember the weather forecast.
The forecast said it would rain.
That forecast was true.
In the evening, it rained.
This is my first rain in the city of Mumbai.
I like the cool wind.
I am very happy.
